### Step 2 - Read seeded products
# Requires: step 0.
# Produces: deterministic product IDs used by cart requests.

GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=10

### Product A - in-stock happy-path product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productAId}}

### Product B - second in-stock product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productBId}}

### Product C - active product with zero stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{outOfStockProductId}}
